('House of Sunny', 'houseofsunny.co.uk', 'shopify', '15860390101375', 'CORDUROY FUNNEL NECK JACKET', 'Outerwear', array['WOMENS','WOMENS ALL']::text[], 180.0, 90.0, 'GBP', 'https://houseofsunny.co.uk/products/womens-chevy-cord-funnel-hi-neck', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Frame125.png?v=1792416138', array['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Frame125.png?v=1792416138','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Instagrampost-14159.png?v=1791898385','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Instagrampost-14160.png?v=1791898400','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Instagrampost-14161.png?v=1791898600','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Instagrampost-14167.png?v=1791898630','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Instagrampost-14168.png?v=1791898631']::text[], 'Crafted from a rich, heavyweight chocolate brown corduroy fabric with a soft, quilted brown-and-cream gingham check lining. Relaxed utility silhouette featuring an internal adjustable drawstring at the waist to define the shape. Designed with a structural funnel high neck collar that can be worn fully zipped or turned down. Functionally built with four front utility patch pockets with flap closures, gold-tone snap hardware, and a gold-tone zip front closure. Detailed with a clean, tonal corduroy', 'House of Sunny', array['XS','S','M','L','XL','2XL','3XL']::text[], '2026-08-27T10:22:38+01:00', array['imma-6']::text[], true, '2026-11-25T19:00:48.895572+00:00'),
