('House of Sunny', 'houseofsunny.co.uk', 'shopify', '15779141550463', 'SUPERBIKES KNIT', 'Knitwear', array['WOMENS','WOMENS ALL']::text[], 115.0, 46.0, 'GBP', 'https://houseofsunny.co.uk/products/womens-knitwear-grey-race-day-motorbike-knit-jumper', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Untitled-1_3e9ac5a0-80bd-4db0-a690-adc10c5f9ee1.jpg?v=1792412185', array['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Untitled-1_3e9ac5a0-80bd-4db0-a690-adc10c5f9ee1.jpg?v=1792412185','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/SUPERBIKES-5.jpg?v=1785423381','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/SUPERBIKES-1_ee7c29d5-5edb-4dbf-9f03-d1a85713008b.jpg?v=1785832349','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/SUPERBIKES_8bf6097a-1f7d-4321-b7b6-1f7cabcee20e.jpg?v=1785832354','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/SUPERBIKES-3.jpg?v=1785423381','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/SUPERBIKES-1.jpg?v=1785423381']::text[], 'Mid-weight, premium jacquard knit fabric in a versatile heather grey base. Oversized, relaxed streetwear silhouette featuring dropped shoulders and a heavy ribbed crew collar, cuffs, and hem. Intricate, multi-colored knit and embroidered artwork across the front of a winding motorsport race track with several speeding superbikes. Asymmetrical block panels in olive green, slate grey, and sky blue running across both sleeves to mirror the track design. Finished with bright red House of Sunny scrip', 'House of Sunny', array['UK S','UK M','UK L','UK XL']::text[], '2026-07-30T16:25:52+01:00', array['imma-4']::text[], true, '2026-11-25T19:00:48.895572+00:00'),
('House of Sunny', 'houseofsunny.co.uk', 'shopify', '15713296253311', 'CAMP TEE', 'T-shirts', array['WOMENS','WOMENS ALL']::text[], 62.0, 24.8, 'GBP', 'https://houseofsunny.co.uk/products/womens-tops-white-camp-graphic-t-shirt', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Frame135.png?v=1792412234', array['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Frame135.png?v=1792412234','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/MALLARDPOINTTEE-6.jpg?v=1785423558','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/CAMP_TEE.jpg?v=1785836746','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/MALLARDPOINTTEE-4.jpg?v=1785423559','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/MALLARD-POINT-TEE-1.jpg?v=1785831297','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Instagrampost-7.png?v=1787650268']::text[], 'Crafted from a mid-weight, soft-touch cotton jersey in clean classic white. Oversized, boyfriend-style silhouette featuring dropped shoulders and longer boxy sleeves. Features a subtle, light blue House of Sunny arc logo printed on the left chest. Highlights a large, distressed vintage-style graphic of a flying mallard duck over a lake landscape with collegiate red branding. An ideal transitional layering piece for casual autumn outfits, pairing perfectly with denim or carpenter pants. Aris is 5', 'House of Sunny', array['S','M','L','XL']::text[], '2026-07-30T16:25:49+01:00', array['aitana-lopez-6']::text[], true, '2026-11-25T19:00:48.895572+00:00'),
('House of Sunny', 'houseofsunny.co.uk', 'shopify', '15713097220479', 'GINGHAM BALLOON CAMI DRESS', 'Dresses', array['WOMENS','WOMENS ALL']::text[], 112.0, 44.8, 'GBP', 'https://houseofsunny.co.uk/products/womens-dresses-olive-green-gingham-balloon-cami-dress', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Frame130.png?v=1792411164', array['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Frame130.png?v=1792411164','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/ChatGPTImageAug4_2026_04_57_43PM.png?v=1785917293','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/GINGHAMBALLOONCAMIDRESS_aa6c6e39-5e2d-4299-80a2-fc19af2102fb.jpg?v=1785917796','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/GINGHAMBALLOONCAMIDRESS_2.jpg?v=1785917796','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/GINGHAMBALLOONCAMIDRESS_1.jpg?v=1785917796','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/GINGHAMBALLOONCAMIDRESS-3.jpg?v=1785423718']::text[], 'Designed with a structured, cinched-in corset bodice that gently nips in the waist to accentuate the volume of the balloon skirt. Lightweight woven fabric patterned with a fine olive green and white micro-gingham check. Sweetheart cami neckline accented with delicate white lace trim and a long satin ribbon tie bow at the center front. The ruching through the body creates a flattering, sculpted silhouette, while the structured internal lining provides additional support. Flowing midi-length skirt', 'House of Sunny', array['UK 6','UK 8','UK 10','UK 12','UK 14','UK 16','UK 18']::text[], '2026-07-30T16:25:48+01:00', array['imma-3']::text[], true, '2026-11-25T19:00:48.895572+00:00'),
('House of Sunny', 'houseofsunny.co.uk', 'shopify', '15712860864895', 'ASYMMETRIC MESH SKIRT WITH FLOWER APPLIQUE', 'Skirts', array['WOMENS','WOMENS ALL']::text[], 62.0, 37.2, 'GBP', 'https://houseofsunny.co.uk/products/womens-skirts-plum-burgundy-sheer-mesh-asymmetric-skirt', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Frame-122.jpg?v=1792418879', array['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/Frame-122.jpg?v=1792418879','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/BURGUNDYMESHSKIRT-2.jpg?v=1785423829','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/BURGUNDYDOUBLELAYERMESHTOP_eff60d69-47e2-409e-9762-4f7f88c2b255.jpg?v=1785836105','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/BURGUNDYDOUBLELAYERMESHTOP-1.jpg?v=1785423836','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/BURGUNDYDOUBLELAYERMESHTOP-2_02174d14-29cb-44ff-9cbe-d67dcd645e8c.jpg?v=1785836111','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0737/8616/3481/files/BURGUNDYMESHSKIRT-1_1.jpg?v=1786367462']::text[], 'Bold, diagonal button-up slit and handkerchief hem for a dynamic silhouette. Sheer fine mesh fabric in a rich deep plum/burgundy shade. Tonal 3D fabric rosetta corsage on the hip. Rou-la loop cover button button detai. Crafted from a lightweight, breathable sheer mesh fabric. Side-Zip Fastening. Ideal for layering over briefs, swimwear, or slip dresses for elevated evening or resort wear. Aris is 5''9 and wears a size S/8 Designed as part of a matching two-piece set. Pair with our matching Burgun', 'House of Sunny', array['UK 6','UK 8','UK 10','UK 12','UK 14','UK 16','UK 18']::text[], '2026-07-30T16:25:46+01:00', array['aitana-lopez-3']::text[], true, '2026-11-25T19:00:48.895572+00:00'),
